@startuml
!theme plain
!pragma layout smetana

title csk schema v6 compiled-build component boundaries

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #6C757D
}

cloud "curator-spec rc.4\nschemas + shared vectors" as Spec

package "Domain and identity" #EAF4FF {
  [Schema v6 manifest model\nTASK-260720-z9j4c9] as Manifest
  [Build-source + context boundary\nTASK-260720-3c0ss2] as Source
  [Trusted Go session + fingerprint\nTASK-260720-3j8pp5] as Toolchain
  [Cache input + receipt + marker v2\nTASK-260720-2dnqw2] as Metadata
}

package "Execution and protected storage" #FFF4E6 {
  [Fixed go-v1 compiler driver\nTASK-260720-2g21eg] as Driver
  [Protected cache interface + POSIX\nTASK-260720-2jfnz6] as PosixCache
  [Protected Windows cache backend\nTASK-260720-8nxlgx] as WindowsCache
}

package "Coordination and activation" #EEFBEF {
  [Lock hierarchy + transaction journal\nTASK-260720-z2z795] as Transaction
  [Runtime validation + platform shims\nTASK-260720-11yhth] as Activation
  [Audit-first build planner + dry-run\nTASK-260720-2x6mjn] as Planner
}

package "Install and maintenance surfaces" #F7EEFF {
  [Project + hybrid atomic install\nTASK-260720-3t8nr3] as ProjectInstall
  [Global atomic install\nTASK-260720-g7kgox] as GlobalInstall
  [Status + repair + locked GC\nTASK-260720-th0jdi] as Maintenance
}

package "Independent evidence" #FFFDE7 {
  [Shared vector consumer\nTASK-260720-12r55p] as Vectors
  [Cross-platform real Go E2E\nTASK-260720-3pemm6] as E2E
  [Author and operator docs\nTASK-260720-akf5kh] as Docs
  [Integrated verification\nTASK-260720-3s27te] as Verify
}

Spec --> Manifest : schema contract
note right of Vectors
  Independently consumes the generated rc.4 suite.
end note

Manifest --> Source : declared roots
Manifest --> Toolchain : active build commands
Source --> Metadata : build_source
Toolchain --> Metadata : target + toolchain
Source --> Driver : frozen snapshot
Toolchain --> Driver : trusted session

Metadata --> PosixCache : logical entry
PosixCache --> WindowsCache : backend contract
WindowsCache --> Activation : immutable artifact

Driver --> Planner : miss preflight
WindowsCache --> Planner : hit / miss / trust
Transaction --> Planner : lock-free plan boundary

Activation --> ProjectInstall : shim targets
Planner --> ProjectInstall : ordered build plan
Transaction --> ProjectInstall : commit / rollback
ProjectInstall --> GlobalInstall : shared install APIs
GlobalInstall --> Maintenance : marker + cache state

Maintenance --> Vectors : currentness lifecycle
Vectors --> E2E : shared expectations
Maintenance --> Docs : observable behavior
E2E --> Verify : platform evidence
Docs --> Verify : documented contract

note bottom of PosixCache
  csk physical layout remains implementation-specific:
  <manager-home>/builds/go-v1/<logical-key>/...
end note

@enduml
